#. module: eh_account_sepa_ct
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_sepa_ct.field_eh_sepa_originator__initiating_party_name
msgid ""
"Goes into GrpHdr/InitgPty/Nm. The exact legal name the bank has on file for "
"the account holder. Capped at 70 characters per the scheme."
msgstr "填入 GrpHdr/InitgPty/Nm。銀行為帳戶持有人存檔的確切法定名稱。依方案限制為 70 個字元。"

#. module: eh_account_sepa_ct
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_sepa_ct.field_eh_sepa_export__message_id
