msgstr "標記在 XML 上的 GrpHdr/MsgId。全域唯一。"

#. module: eh_account_sepa_ct
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:eh_account_sepa_ct.field_eh_sepa_export__has_message
msgid "Has Message"
msgstr "有訊息"

#. module: eh_account_sepa_ct
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:eh_account_sepa_ct.field_eh_sepa_originator__iban
msgid "IBAN"
msgstr ""

#. module: eh_account_sepa_ct
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:eh_account_sepa_ct.view_eh_sepa_originator_form
msgid ""
"IBAN and BIC are validated locally on save: ISO 13616 mod-97 for IBAN, ISO "
"9362 structure for BIC. The export refuses to render when validation fails "
"so configuration errors surface here, not mid-payment-run."
msgstr ""
"IBAN 和 BIC 在儲存時進行本機驗證：IBAN 使用 ISO 13616 mod-97，BIC 使用 ISO 9362 "
"結構。當驗證失敗時，匯出將拒絕產生，因此組態錯誤會在此處顯現，而不是在付款作業中途。"

#. module: eh_account_sepa_ct
#. odoo-python
